Third-party material
--------------------

Art and sound by Kenney (https://kenney.nl), CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain).
Credit is not required; it is given anyway.
  - Cube Pets, Blocky Characters, Mini Characters: rendered to the GIFs in
    mods/zoo/packs/ by scripts/render_cube_pets.py and scripts/render_kenney.py.
  - Music Jingles, Interface Sounds: converted to the jingle-*.mp3 and ui-*.mp3
    files in mods/zoo/sounds/ by scripts/kenney_sounds.py.

Herdr (https://herdr.dev)
  These mods start from Herdr's own shipped mods, cloned with Herdr's `mod.clone`
  and then changed:
    mods/my-tabs       <- tabs
    mods/my-pane       <- pane
    mods/my-status     <- workspace-status
    mods/my-new-menu   <- new-menu
    mods/zoo-agents    <- agents
  The layouts in layouts/ start from Herdr's `main` layout. Herdr and its shipped
  mods belong to their authors; this project is not affiliated with Herdr.

Our own
  The tiles in mods/zoo/tiles/ (scripts/make_tiles.py) and the five synthesized
  effects in mods/zoo/sounds/ (scripts/make_sounds.py: alert-blips, chime-up,
  level-up, ping, two-tone) are original to this project and covered by the
  MIT License.
